        "sentence_id": "p1_s2"
      },
      "text": "This vulnerability occurred in parsing RTF files and was assigned CVE-2014-1761 , a thorough analysis of which used to deliver malware and one was particularly interesting as it contained a new variant of MiniDuke (also known as Win32/SandyEva ).",
      "language": "en",
