        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s3"
      },
      "text": "MiniDuke was first discussed by Kaspersky in March 2013 in their paper The MiniDuke Mystery: PDF 0- day Government Spy Assembler 0x29A Micro Backdoor and shortly after in a paper by Bitdefender.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
