      "locator": {
        "page": 7,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p7_s3"
      },
      "text": "The malware processes the downloaded file in the same way as previous samples of MiniDuke: it verifies the integrity of the file using",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_29",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Miniduke_twitter",
      "locator": {
        "page": 8,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p8_s1"
      },
      "text": "The TwitterJS module is extracted by creating a copy of the Windows DLL cryptdll.dll, injecting a block of code into it and redirecting the exported functions to this code.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
